OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidely a chilly and murky
OL,6,Fstart, with mist and fog only slowly
OL,7,Flifting and clearing towards
OL,8,Flunchtime. Some eventual sunny spells
OL,9,Fthen developing. Winds staying light,
OL,10,Fwith near-normal temperatures.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FVariable amount of cloud
OL,13,Fthough most inland parts will remain
OL,14,Fdry. Long clear spells inland are
OL,15,Flikely after midnight, though frost
OL,16,Fand areas of fog are expected to
OL,17,Fdevelop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
