OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAreas of fog will be slow to
OL,6,Fclear in many places on Monday,
OL,7,Felsewhere some bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Fmay develop. Light winds and average
OL,9,Ftemperatures where the fog clears.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fbut dry at first on Tuesday, soon
OL,13,Fgiving way to breezier conditions and
OL,14,Frain from the southwest. Wednesday
OL,15,Funsettled before turning drier and
OL,16,Fbrighter from the north on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
